  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Zendiator 0.3.0: generated handlers and behaviors default to Transient with a Scoped mediator; generated mediators no longer implement IDisposable or guarantee ObjectDisposedException after scope disposal. Lifetime analyzer warnings, composition-specific resolver slots, and a reproducible use-case benchmark are included. AddZendiator() and IZendiator.SendAsync remain the standard entry points. See https://github.com/Htkym/zendiator/blob/v0.3.0/docs/release/0.3.0-release-notes.md",
